OL,3,GNEWSAIt's within DUP's gift to remove
OL,4,AO'Neill as first minister, says
OL,5,ALockhart
OL,6,
OL,7,FO'Neill is one of a number of Sinn Fein
OL,8,Fpoliticians who have confirmed they
OL,9,Freceived letters from the Police
OL,10,FService of Northern Ireland (PSNI)
OL,11,Finvestigating protests over the
OL,12,FDrumcree parading dispute.
